WEBVTT

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:01.368
Hello, I'm Lizzie.

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:03.937
I'm a third year
studying Human Computer Interaction.

00:00:04.371 --> 00:00:08.641
Something fun that I participate in
on campus is the Game Development Club

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.243
called Game Creation Society.

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:15.048
Last year, I pitched a small little game
about working at a train station,

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:19.386
and through that experience,
I worked on my technical skills.

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:20.553
I made a lot of friends.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:25.658
Working with all of these amazing people
has taught me a lot about project management,

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:29.996
presentation, and also technical skills
because I was the programmer for that project.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:34.634
I was also able to showcase
this project at different events

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:39.439
like ScottySpark and ScottyCon
and SCS Day and so many others.